CORE
main.sh
--show-parse-tree
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^dialect posix$
^    assign x = lit"1"$
^    assign y = lit"two"$
^  pipeline @3:1$
^      word dq\(param\(x\)\)$
^  or @4:1$
^    and @4:1$
^    simple negated @5:1$
^  simple background @6:1$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Simple commands, assignments, pipelines, and AND-OR lists (POSIX.1-2024
XCU 2.9.1-2.9.3). "!" applies to the first pipeline only.
